{"id":"244796","name":"酱腌洋姜","author":"食·色","authorId":"34360","desc":"","cover":"images/244796/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"洋姜","amount":"500克"},{"name":"甜面酱","amount":"250克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"150克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"40克"},{"name":"白酒","amount":"50克"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"75克"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"八角","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洋姜洗净","img":"images/244796/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放在通风处阴凉风干","img":"images/244796/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"表面略有些脱水","img":"images/244796/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备调料","img":"images/244796/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将花椒，八角放入锅中，加水置火上熬煮","img":"images/244796/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"沸腾数分钟，熄火晾凉","img":"images/244796/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将洋姜装入坛子，加入甜面酱","img":"images/244796/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入盐，","img":"images/244796/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入白糖","img":"images/244796/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入生抽","img":"images/244796/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入白酒","img":"images/244796/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后将冷却的花椒八角水倒入坛子","img":"images/244796/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"让洋姜完全被酱汁淹没","img":"images/244796/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加盖，密封腌制20天","img":"images/244796/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"揭盖","img":"images/244796/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"取出洋姜","img":"images/244796/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切片食用","img":"images/244796/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"洋姜腌制前需风干水分，否则容易变质腐烂，且腌制后口感不脆爽。\n花椒八角水煮开后必须彻底凉透才能使用。\n酱汁一定要没过洋姜， \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其它、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}